{"id":"jzxrfc9vg7ry6ch7qd3k08m7v","title":"古代文献常用（今人费解）词语（155）：山踯躅","originalTitle":null,"summary":"\"山踯躅\"是古代文献中杜鹃花的雅称，因花形与羊踯躅相似且传说羊食其叶后会死亡而得名。李时珍《本草纲目》记载，杜鹃花\"花如羊踯躅\"，故称\"山踯躅\"。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=1251036&do=blog&id=1560769"},"publishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":"2026-11-12T00:45:19.041Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-12T00:45:19.041Z","category":null,"tags":["论文发表"],"score":16,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}